# SafeInstall trust-ledger transient mutex files — never commit. Scoped to the
# ledger mutex by exact name: a blanket `*.lock` would also ignore the
# committed trust-surface.lock, which IS the CI re-verification anchor.
.safeinstall/ledger.jsonl.lock
.safeinstall/ledger.jsonl.lock.stale-*
